# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust / Cargo build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Defensive: catches any nested target/ created by a worker that ran cargo
# with the wrong cwd (added in packet 89 closure after a stray
# resources/target/ was discovered).
**/target/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled WASM module/component artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.wasm

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor & OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust backup files
**/*.rs.bk
# Windows debugging information
*.pdb
# Python linter cache
.ruff_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-specific
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OrcaSlicer reference checkout (documentation source, not part of this repo)
/OrcaSlicerDocumented/
# Local worktrees and scratch output
.worktrees/
tmp/
# Local environment files
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Canonical agent tooling lives in .agents/ (Agent Skills standard).
# The .claude/ mirror below is generated by `cargo xtask sync-agents` and
# must never be committed.
/CLAUDE.md
.claude/skills/
.claude/agents/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
# Harness-local settings and imports
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.commandcode/
